    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can move as you attack.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> 13</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When making an attack with a melee or ranged weapon, you can move both before and after the attack, provided that the total distance moved is not greater than your Speed.</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Additional_Running_Attack_Effects\">Additional Running Attack Effects</span></h2><p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Combined_Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Combined Feat\"><b>Combined Feat</b></a><b> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dodge\" title=\"Dodge\">Dodge</a>):</b> You can add your dodge bonus to your&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>&nbsp;against anyone who makes an&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack of Opportunity\">Attack of Opportunity</a>&nbsp;against you while using the&nbsp;Running Attack&nbsp;Feat.</p>",
